{{!
    @template mod_aiactivities/ai_notice

    Tells learners the activities were made with AI and who checked them (EU AI Act, Article 50), and carries a
    machine-readable marker (schema.org JSON-LD with the IPTC digital source type for AI-created content).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * show - bool, whether the visible notice is shown
    * message - string, the notice text
    * narrated - bool, whether the narration is an AI voice
    * marker - string, JSON-LD marker

    Example context (json):
    {
        "show": true,
        "message": "Made with AI and checked by Maya Chen on 28 November 2026.",
        "narrated": true,
        "reviewed": true,
        "marker": "{}"
    }
}}
<script type="application/ld+json" class="ala-ai-marker">{{{marker}}}</script>
{{#show}}
<div class="ala-ai-notice" role="note" data-ai-generated="true">
    <span class="ala-ai-notice-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i></span>
    <span class="ala-ai-notice-text">
        <span class="mds-badge badge mds-badge--subtle mds-badge--info ala-ai-notice-badge">{{#str}}ainotice_badge, mod_aiactivities{{/str}}</span>
        <span>{{message}}</span>
        {{#narrated}}<span class="ala-ai-notice-voice">{{#str}}ainotice_voice, mod_aiactivities{{/str}}</span>{{/narrated}}
    </span>
    <a class="ala-ai-notice-link" href="#" data-action="ala-ai-about" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ala-ai-about">{{#str}}ainotice_about, mod_aiactivities{{/str}}</a>
</div>
<div class="ala-ai-about" id="ala-ai-about" hidden>
    <p>{{#str}}ainotice_about_text, mod_aiactivities{{/str}}</p>
</div>
{{/show}}
